    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56524" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κελτοί</span></b> , οἱ,
			<u>Celts</u>, <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			2.33
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			X.
			<u>HG</u>
			7.1.20
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Plb.
			1.13.4
		</span></i>:—later <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κέλται</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			Str.
			4.1.1
		</span></i>, etc.:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κελτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Celtic, Gallic</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.1.3
			</span></i>: —poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κελτός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Del.</u>
				173
			</span></i>:—fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κελτίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				10.21
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ Κελτική</span> the
				<i>country of the Celts</i> or <u>Gauls</u>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				606b4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				4.1.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ Κελτία</span> Foed. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				7.9.6
			</span></i>.</div>
